    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wealth Project is Here: Learn, Play, Prosper!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80<strong> Start Your Journey Today!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wealth Project </strong>is a game that will inspire both kids and adults to take control of their financial futures! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore puzzles and point-and-click adventures based on real success stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Learn simple ways to manage money, calculate your net worth, and build meaningful life goals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover how your dreams and career choices shape your path to wealth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re just starting or already on the journey, <strong>Wealth Project</strong> offers an engaging way to learn essential life skills in a fun, interactive environment! \ud83c\udf31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Thank you for your support</strong>: This is just the beginning\u2014new content and updates are on the way! Be sure to <strong>follow and wishlist</strong> the game to stay in the loop. \ud83c\udf89</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Wealth Project is an inspiring educational Puzzles and Point &amp; Click game teaching kids and grown-ups about wealth, success stories and much more.  The game is made for those who are starting their wealth journey. <br><br>What you will learn<br><br>How to get to present moment<br>How to manage money in a simple level and how to divide your things into assets and liabilities. <br>How to calculate your net worth  <br>How choosing your career path and your dream affect the time it takes to reach them<br>How to ask advice from your future self<br>How to set life goals that are meaningful",
    "about_the_game": "Wealth Project is an inspiring educational Puzzles and Point &amp; Click game teaching kids and grown-ups about wealth, success stories and much more.  The game is made for those who are starting their wealth journey. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat you will learn<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to get to present moment<br />\r\nHow to manage money in a simple level and how to divide your things into assets and liabilities. <br />\r\nHow to calculate your net worth  <br />\r\nHow choosing your career path and your dream affect the time it takes to reach them<br />\r\nHow to ask advice from your future self<br />\r\nHow to set life goals that are meaningful",
    "short_description": "Wealth Project is a fun and inspiring Visual Novel, Point &amp; Click game with puzzles and mini-games made for anyone starting their wealth-building journey. Learn essential concepts like money management, goal setting, and net worth calculation while exploring success stories.",
